# Skyward Air repo: an allow-list. The code, scripts and notes go in git; the Unreal project's binary
# content (Content/*.uasset, *.umap) is attached to the GitHub Release as zips instead.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.py
!*.ps1
!*.cmd
!*.md
!*.ini
!*.uproject
!*.json
!*.html
!Slider*/img/*.jpg
!Slider*/pairs/*.jpg

# other projects in this folder
/Animations/
/Characters/
/Emotes/
/TwinTowers/
/Opus_5_5_Handoff/
/Opus_5_5_Handoff.zip

# generated, cached or bulky
**/Backup/
**/Backups/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/Screenshots/
**/Snapshots/
**/Versions/
**/Exports/
**/SourceAssets/
**/*Build/
**/Look/
**/Preview/
**/Logs/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
